  "content": "<!-- Mode select -->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <section class=\"screen mode-select is-active\" id=\"screen-home\" aria-label=\"Game modes\">\n   <div class=\"mode-select__brand\">\n    <img class=\"mode-select__brand-logo\" src=\"https://corporatemindgames.com/WebsiteLogo.png\" alt=\"\">\n    <div class=\"mode-select__brand-copy\">\n     <p>Sharpen your workplace instincts</p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"mode-grid\">\n    <div class=\"mode-group\">\n     <div class=\"mode-group__header\">\n      <p class=\"mode-group__label\">Daily Challenges</p>\n      <p class=\"mode-group__note\">Each game below has one puzzle per day</p>\n     </div>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-card\" data-mode=\"rto\"><span class=\"mode-card__copy\"> <span class=\"mode-card__title\">Prep Office For RTO</span> <span class=\"mode-card__desc\"> Perfect the office vibes so everyone comes back to work </span> <span class=\"mode-card__play-status\" data-daily-status=\"rto\" data-state=\"pending\">Today's Result: Pending</span> </span></button>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-card\" data-mode=\"daily\"><span class=\"mode-card__copy\"> <span class=\"mode-card__title\">Plan The Roadmap</span> <span class=\"mode-card__desc\"> Build a roadmap that aligns with leadership's vision </span> <span class=\"mode-card__play-status\" data-daily-status=\"daily\" data-state=\"pending\">Today's Result: Pending</span> </span></button>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-card\" data-mode=\"orgchart\"><span class=\"mode-card__copy\"> <span class=\"mode-card__title\">Modernize The Org Chart</span> <span class=\"mode-card__desc\"> Create harmony between humans and AI Agents </span> <span class=\"mode-card__play-status\" data-daily-status=\"org\" data-state=\"pending\">Today's Result: Pending</span> </span></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mode-group\">\n     <div class=\"mode-group__header\">\n      <p class=\"mode-group__label\">Mindless Tasks</p>\n      <p class=\"mode-group__note\">Play to numb your mind</p>\n     </div>\n     <button type=\"button\" class=\"mode-card\" data-mode=\"presentation\"><span class=\"mode-card__copy\"> <span class=\"mode-card__title\">Finish The Presentation</span> <span class=\"mode-card__desc\"> Nail the timing of your slide deck </span> </span></button>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <!-- Plan The Roadmap -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" id=\"screen-daily\" aria-label=\"Plan The Roadmap\">\n   <div class=\"daily\">\n    <div class=\"daily__stage\">\n     <div class=\"daily__stage-fill\">\n      <div class=\"screenshare__hud\" aria-label=\"Session stats\">\n       <div class=\"screenshare__stat\">\n        <span class=\"screenshare__stat-label\">Time</span> <strong id=\"daily-timer\">0:00</strong>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"screenshare__stat\">\n        <span class=\"screenshare__stat-label\">Moves</span> <strong id=\"daily-moves\">0</strong>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"screenshare__hud-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"screenshare__mute\" id=\"daily-mute-btn\" aria-label=\"Mute game sound\" title=\"Mute\"></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"screenshare__reset\" id=\"daily-reset\">Reset</button>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"screenshare\" aria-label=\"Shared screen: product roadmap\">\n       <div class=\"roadmap\" id=\"roadmap\">\n        <section class=\"quarter\" data-quarter=\"Backlog\">\n         <div class=\"quarter__header\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__label\">Tickets</span> <span class=\"quarter__tickets-label\">Tickets</span>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"quarter__targets quarter__targets--spacer\">\n          <p class=\"quarter__tickets-hint\">Drag tickets to the right and satisfy every requirement. Make the sad faces turn happy.</p>\n         </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"quarter\" data-quarter=\"Q1\">\n         <div class=\"quarter__header\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__label\">Q1</span>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"quarter__targets\" data-quarter-points=\"Q1\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 points</span> </span> <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 tickets</span> </span>\n         </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"quarter\" data-quarter=\"Q2\">\n         <div class=\"quarter__header\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__label\">Q2</span>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"quarter__targets\" data-quarter-points=\"Q2\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 points</span> </span> <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 tickets</span> </span>\n         </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"quarter\" data-quarter=\"Q3\">\n         <div class=\"quarter__header\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__label\">Q3</span>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"quarter__targets\" data-quarter-points=\"Q3\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 points</span> </span> <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 tickets</span> </span>\n         </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"quarter\" data-quarter=\"Q4\">\n         <div class=\"quarter__header\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__label\">Q4</span>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"quarter__targets\" data-quarter-points=\"Q4\">\n          <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 points</span> </span> <span class=\"quarter__target-row is-bad\"> <span><strong>0</strong> / 0 tickets</span> </span>\n         </div>\n        </section>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <!-- Escape placeholder -->\n  <section class=\"screen placeholder\" id=\"screen-escape\">\n   <h2>Escape the Virtual Room</h2>\n   <p>Scaffolding only — coming later.</p>\n   <button type=\"button\" class=\"ghost-btn\" data-home>Back</button>\n  </section>\n  <!-- Modernize The Org Chart -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" id=\"screen-orgchart\" aria-label=\"Modernize The Org Chart\">\n   <div class=\"org\">\n    <div class=\"org__stage\">\n     <div class=\"org-board\" aria-label=\"Org chart puzzle\">\n      <div class=\"org-hud\" aria-label=\"Session stats\">\n       <div class=\"org-hud__stats\">\n        <div class=\"org-hud__stat\">\n         <span class=\"org-hud__label\">Time</span> <strong id=\"org-timer\">0:00</strong>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"org-hud__stat\">\n         <span class=\"org-hud__label\">Moves</span> <strong id=\"org-moves\">0</strong>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"org-hud__actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"org-reset\" id=\"org-reset\">Reset</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"org-hint\" id=\"org-hint\">Hint</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"org-mute\" id=\"org-mute-btn\" aria-label=\"Mute game sound\" title=\"Mute\"></button>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"org-pool-wrap\">\n       <div class=\"org-pool-label\">Unassigned</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"org-meta\" id=\"org-meta\">Drag stickies onto seats to staff the chart.</div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <!-- Prep Office For RTO -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" id=\"screen-rto\" aria-label=\"Prep Office For RTO\">\n   <div class=\"rto\">\n    <div class=\"rto__stage\">\n     <div class=\"rto-board\" aria-label=\"Office floor plan\">\n      <div class=\"rto-hud\" aria-label=\"Session stats\">\n       <div class=\"rto-hud__stats\">\n        <div class=\"rto-hud__stat\">\n         <span class=\"rto-hud__label\">Time</span> <strong id=\"rto-timer\">0:00</strong>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rto-hud__stat\">\n         <span class=\"rto-hud__label\">Moves</span> <strong id=\"rto-moves\">0</strong>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"rto-hud__actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"rto-reset\" id=\"rto-reset\">Reset</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"rto-mute\" id=\"rto-mute-btn\" aria-label=\"Mute game sound\" title=\"Mute\"></button>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rto-tray\" id=\"rto-tray\" aria-label=\"Feng shui sticky notes\"></div>\n      <p class=\"rto-meta\" id=\"rto-meta\">Drag the exact stickies onto open areas in the floor plan. Drag between spots to move or swap.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <!-- Finish the Presentation -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" id=\"screen-presentation\" aria-label=\"Finish the Presentation\">\n   <div class=\"preso\">\n    <div class=\"preso__stage\" id=\"preso-stage\">\n     <div class=\"preso-main\" id=\"preso-main\">\n      <div class=\"preso-deck\">\n       <div class=\"preso-share\" id=\"preso-share\">\n        <div class=\"preso-share__bar\">\n         <span><strong>You</strong> are sharing — strategy-deck.pptx</span> <span id=\"preso-talk-status\">Screenshare</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"preso-slide\">\n         <button type=\"button\" class=\"preso-share__mute\" id=\"preso-mute-btn\" aria-label=\"Mute game sound\" title=\"Mute\"></button>\n         <div class=\"preso-slide__inner\">\n          <p class=\"preso-slide__kicker\" id=\"preso-kicker\">Slide 1 of 20</p>\n          <h2 class=\"preso-slide__title\" id=\"preso-title\">Agenda</h2>\n          <p class=\"preso-slide__target\">Hit next slide as time runs out</p>\n          <p class=\"preso-countdown\" id=\"preso-countdown\">5.00</p>\n          <div class=\"preso-slide__actions\">\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"preso-reset\" id=\"preso-reset\">Start Over</button>\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"preso-advance\" id=\"preso-advance\"><span id=\"preso-advance-label\">Next slide</span></button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"preso-results\" id=\"preso-results\">\n        <div class=\"preso-results__card\">\n         <h2 id=\"preso-results-title\">Presentation complete</h2>\n         <div class=\"preso-results__grade\" id=\"preso-grade\">A+</div>\n         <div class=\"preso-results__stats\" id=\"preso-final-score\">\n          <div>\n           <span class=\"preso-results__stat-label\">Total error</span> <strong id=\"preso-total-error\">0.00s</strong>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n           <span class=\"preso-results__stat-label\">Average error</span> <strong id=\"preso-avg-error\">0.00s</strong>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <p id=\"preso-grade-message\">Total timing error across 10 slides.</p>\n         <div class=\"preso-results__actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"primary-btn\" id=\"preso-share-score\">Share score</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"ghost-btn\" id=\"preso-again\">Present again</button>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "一个基于网络的平台，提供每日互动挑战，以磨练职场直觉，包括优化办公室布局、协调路线图与领导层，以及管理人类-AI 团队动态的游戏。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "一个基于网络的平台，提供每日互动挑战，以磨练职场直觉，包括优化办公室布局、协调路线图与领导层，以及管理人类-AI 团队动态的游戏。",
  "summary": "企业思维游戏提供了一套游戏化练习，旨在提高企业决策能力。该平台包含每日谜题，例如“为 RTO 准备办公室”（优化办公室空间以支持重返工作）、“规划路线图”（将项目时间表与执行愿景对齐），以及“现代化组织图”（将 AI 代理集成到团队结构中）。此外，它还提供“无脑任务”用于缓解压力，包括一个演示计时游戏和一个票务排序挑战。",
